{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773858316,"nonce":"Pyw8thUH4N1MgeVQSDXc2er/FPQ=","title":"auth request: --closes-issue flag for declaring issues to close on merge","message":"Currently, umbrella issues in bigbuild workflows are never auto-closed because partition subagents commit with their own child issue IDs (Bug: trailers), not the umbrella issue ID.\n\nThis feature adds an optional closes_issues field to auth requests, allowing the submitter to declare issue IDs that should be closed when the merge completes, independent of Bug: trailers in commit messages.\n\nChanges:\n- Add --closes-issue repeatable CLI flag to mandible auth request\n- Add closes_issues optional array field to auth request schema (API + DB)\n- On merge completion, close declared issues using same mechanism as Bug: trailer auto-close\n- Backward compatible: field is optional with no default","files":null}]}